{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZR","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以斯拉記","commonName":"以斯拉記","title":"以斯拉記","order":15,"numberOfChapters":10,"sha256":"447f6d2ded415027158508a4cb01df16e213b29699e4533bfd48f99600ebf522","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZR/1.json","lastChapterNumber":10,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZR/10.json","totalNumberOfVerses":280},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["塞魯士下令猶太人返國"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["波斯王塞魯士元年，耶和華為要應驗藉耶利米口所說的話，就激動波斯王塞魯士的心，使他下詔通告全國說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「波斯王塞魯士如此說：『耶和華天上的上帝已將天下萬國賜給我，又囑咐我在猶大的耶路撒冷為他建造殿宇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["在你們中間凡作他子民的，可以上猶大的耶路撒冷，在耶路撒冷重建耶和華－以色列上帝的殿（只有他是上帝）。願上帝與這人同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["凡剩下的人，無論寄居何處，那地的人要用金銀、財物、牲畜幫助他，另外也要為耶路撒冷上帝的殿甘心獻上禮物。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，猶大和便雅憫的族長、祭司、利未人，就是一切被上帝激動他心的人，都起來要上耶路撒冷去建造耶和華的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他們四圍的人就拿銀器、金子、財物、牲畜、珍寶幫助他們",{"noteId":0},"，另外還有甘心獻的禮物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["塞魯士王也將耶和華殿的器皿拿出來，這器皿是尼布甲尼撒從耶路撒冷掠來、放在自己神之廟中的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["波斯王塞魯士派庫官米提利達將這器皿拿出來，按數交給猶大的首領設巴薩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["器皿的數目記在下面：金盤三十個，銀盤一千個，刀二十九把，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["金碗三十個，銀碗之次的四百一十個，別樣的器皿一千件。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["金銀器皿共有五千四百件。被擄的人從巴比倫上耶路撒冷的時候，設巴薩將這一切都帶上來。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是堅固他們的手","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZR/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZR/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/36.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}